    "ssh destination, such as a Host in ~/.ssh/config (omit for this machine)":
        "ssh の宛先。~/.ssh/config の Host など (この機器なら省略)",
    "mac / linux: apply the default cap at boot (default: off)": "mac / linux: 起動時に既定の上限をかける (既定: off)",
    "remove the agent from a device and forget it": "機器から agent を外し、登録も消す",
